RL_Paint
9|This plugin draws a line from the tip of your car to help you visualize what is going on when using directional air roll
8|
1|Enabled|paint_enabled
7|
1|Draw start point|paint_visualize_start_point
1|Relative Mode|paint_relative
6|Mode|paint_mode|Trailing@0&Never@1&Reset@2&Wall@3
5|Points|paint_points|20|10000
7|
9|-  120 points makes just about a circle when trailing.
5|Start Point|paint_start_point|-300|300
7|
9|-  74 is just in front of a octane car, 80 is default.
9|Tip: You can ctrl+click the slider to set a specific number
9|
8|
0|Freeze|paint_freeze
7|
9|Teleports you to the middle of the field with -1 gravity and 0 velocity.
0|Restore gravity to default|sv_soccar_gravity -650
8|
1|Draw Ballhit Markers|paint_ballhits
7|
1|Draw Flipreset Sphere|paint_flipreset
7|
1|Draw Stick Direction|paint_stickDirection
6|Start Point Type|paint_startpoint_mode|Pin@0&Sphere with Line@1&Dot@2&Brush@3
8|
0|Refresh settings|cl_settings_refreshplugins
